# Code of Conduct

We expect respectful, inclusive behavior in all community spaces.

## Expected behavior
- Be kind.
- Be constructive.
- Respect different backgrounds and skill levels.

## Unacceptable behavior
- Harassment
- Abuse
- Hate speech
- Spamming
SECURITY.md
# Security Policy

## Supported versions
Only the latest stable version is supported.

## Reporting a vulnerability
Send security issues privately to the maintainers.
Do not open public issues for sensitive reports.
